  <!-- Introduction -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 prose prose-lg prose-blue">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">
        Why North Alabama Homes Need Exterior Painting Done Right
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        The exterior of your North Alabama home takes a punishment most homeowners never think about until the damage is visible. Summer UV index in Madison and Huntsville routinely hits 10–11 — among the highest in the continental United States. That UV radiation breaks down paint film chemistry from the first day it's applied, causing chalking, fading, and eventually delamination. Layer that with spring and fall humidity that can hover above 80% for weeks, hard winter freezes that crack caulk and cause moisture to migrate behind paint film, and the violent thermal cycling of Alabama summers where a single day can swing 40°F — and you have a climate that exposes every shortcut and material substitution a painter makes.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        The homes in Madison, Harvest, Hampton Cove, and across Huntsville that look fresh and vibrant a decade after painting have one thing in common: they were prepared correctly and painted with premium product. The ones that are peeling in four years skipped the primer, used contractor-grade paint, rushed past the scraping, and are now spending twice as much to redo the job properly. At Rittenworx, we follow the process that produces 12–15 year paint jobs because that's what you're actually paying for when you invest in a quality exterior repaint.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-4">
        What Goes Into an Exterior Painting Quote
      </h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Every exterior paint job is different. The main things that affect the price are the square footage of paintable surface, the number of stories, the condition of the surface (the more prep needed, the more involved the job), and the paint product selected.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-base italic mb-8">
        Heavy prep — extensive scraping, significant wood rot repair, or recoating a poorly prepped prior paint job — adds to the work involved. We price every job on-site and itemize every line so you know exactly what drives the number.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's Included -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Exterior Painting Services We Provide</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Complete exterior painting from power wash to final walkthrough.
        </p>
      </div>
